Description: Unofficial Linux host for NetEase UU Remote
 Control a Linux desktop from the official NetEase UU Remote clients
 (Mac / Windows / mobile). X11, Hyprland/wlroots and GNOME/KDE portal
 capture, uinput or portal input, clipboard, audio, file transfer,
 terminal and port mapping. Not affiliated with NetEase.
Homepage: https://github.com/VallierDev/uu-remote-linux
